# NOTE: git does NOT support trailing inline comments on a pattern line — the "#" and everything
# after it becomes part of the pattern. Every comment here is on its own line.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets & runtime configuration — NEVER commit.
# The Webhook URL is entered at RUNTIME in the app's Settings screen and stored only in the app's
# private SharedPreferences ON THE DEVICE (/data/data/com.revshield.spamprobe/shared_prefs/
# revshield-probe.xml). It is never part of the source tree. These patterns are a hard guard in case
# a prefs dump, export, or credential file is ever pulled into the working directory.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets.properties
secrets.json
shared_prefs/
**/shared_prefs/
revshield-probe.xml
webhook*.txt
webhook*.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Machine-specific — must be created locally by each developer.
# local.properties holds YOUR Android SDK path (sdk.dir=...).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
local.properties

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Build output
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
captures/
.cxx/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.class
*.log

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Node (not used by this project, but guards an accidental tooling install)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IDE / editor / OS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Stray source archives — never ship duplicate/stale snapshots of the source tree.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
